  <ECEntityClass typeName="BusbarPhysicalCustomAspect" displayLabel="Busbar Physical Custom Aspect" description="A conductor, or group of conductors, with negligible impedance, that serve to connect other conducting equipment within a single substation. &#x000d; Voltage measurements are typically obtained from voltage transformers that are connected to busbars. A busbar may have many physical terminals but for analysis is modelled with exactly one logical terminal." modifier="None">
